1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,170
How did the woman get help?
这位妇女是怎样得到救助的？

2
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:15,560
How did the woman get help?
这位妇女是怎样得到救助的？

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,450
When a light passenger plane flew off course some time ago,
不久前，一架轻型客机偏离了航线，

4
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:27,150
it crashed in the mountains and its pilot was killed.
在山区坠毁，飞行员丧生。

5
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:34,890
The only passengers, a young woman and her two baby daughters, were unhurt.
仅有的乘客，一位年轻妇女和她两个女婴，却安然无恙。

6
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:38,110
It was the middle of winter.
当时正是隆冬季节。

7
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:41,190
Snow lay thick on the ground.
地上积着厚厚的雪。

8
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:46,710
The woman knew that the nearest village was miles away.
妇女知道最近的村庄也在几英里之外。

9
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:56,150
When it grew dark, she turned a suitcase into a bed and put the children inside it,
天黑下来时，她把手提箱当成床，把孩子放了进去，

10
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:59,510
covering them with all the clothes she could find.
用她能找到的所有衣服盖在他们身上。

11
00:01:00,690 --> 00:01:04,260
During the night, it got terribly cold.
夜里天气变得极冷。

12
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:08,930
The woman kept as near as she could to the children
妇女尽量紧挨着孩子们，

13
00:01:08,950 --> 00:01:14,800
and even tried to get into the case herself, but it was too small.
甚至试图自己也钻进箱子里，但箱子太小了。

14
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:17,630
Early next morning,
第二天凌晨，

15
00:01:17,650 --> 00:01:24,030
she heard planes passing overhead and wondered how she could send a signal.
她听到飞机从头顶飞过，不知道怎样才能发出信号。

16
00:01:24,950 --> 00:01:33,630
Then she had an idea She stamped out the letters 'SOS' in the snow.
后来她有了主意，在雪地上踩出了“SOS”这几个字母。

17
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:41,810
Fortunately, a pilot saw the signal and sent a message by radio to the nearest town.
幸好一位飞行员看到了信号，用无线电向最近的城镇发了消息。

18
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:49,530
It was not long before a helicopter arrived on the scene to rescue the survivors of the plane crash.
不久，一架直升机赶到现场，营救了飞机失事的幸存者。
